 "method": "per truth note: among the outputs with the same pitch starting within +/-150 ms, take the nearest; delta = out.start - truth.start. The first note of each sample is excluded: it starts at t = 0 with no silence in front of it, so every engine fires on the first frame and the delta is 0 by construction — a different condition, not a reading. A constant must (1) come from a set the tool did not choose — spoken (any pitch) >= 0.9 of the notes on EVERY sample — and (2) reproduce across >= 5 samples of the same condition, judged by the band of the per-sample medians, not by a pairwise difference. Matched counts are reported and never used as a gate: a pitch error is not a refusal to speak.",
